@startuml
title KTOB — Find a Copy, Save Offer and Record Acquisition
actor Reader
participant "Angular UI" as UI
participant "Java API" as API
participant "Acquisition module" as Acq
participant "Verified retailer source [TBD]" as Seller
database "Supabase Postgres" as DB
Reader -> UI : Find a copy of selected work
UI -> API : Query(format, language, location=Tunisia, budget)
API -> Acq : research offers
alt Validated seller research provider available
 Acq -> Seller : locate verified listings
 Seller --> Acq : sourced offers + lookup time
 Acq --> API : identified matches with uncertainty
else Provider absent or no verified matches
 Acq --> API : no verified offers available
end
API --> UI : source links / empty state
opt Reader saves a known listing
 Reader -> UI : Save offer
 UI -> API : Save source URL and observed details
 API -> Acq : verify reader + work ownership
 Acq -> DB : save historical offer
 DB --> API : stored offer
end
opt Reader has obtained a copy
 Reader -> UI : I acquired / borrowed / accessed this book
 UI -> API : Create acquisition record (optional details)
 API -> Acq : verify reader, store acquisition
 Acq -> DB : save access / ownership record
 DB --> API : created
end
note over UI,DB
Saving an offer != purchase.
Purchase/access != reading status.
No price or stock is invented if unverified.
end note
@enduml
